                        <div class="product-title">
                <h1>Ayalon-PI 30/70 Fund</h1>
                                    <p class="product-slogan">Balanced Growth with Stability</p>
                            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="product-content">
            <p class="product-description-paragraph">PI Financial Ltd., a company under PI Group, provides investment advisory services to Ayalon Investment House, Who is one of the largest investment houses in Israel, managing approximately 235 mutual funds with a total value of about 34.8* billion NIS, on the "Ayalon PI 30/70" Mutual fund.</p>            
            <p class="product-description-paragraph">* <small><small>as of December 2024</small></small></p><p class="product-description-paragraph"><small><small><p><b>Ayalon PI 30/70 (id: 5102157)</b><br>Exposure Profile: 2B</br>Stocks: 2 - up to 30% of the fund's net asset value</br>Foreign Currency: B - up to 30% of the fund's net asset value</p></small></small></p><p class="product-description-paragraph"><small><small><p><b>Disclaimer</b><br><small>B2 - up to 30% exposure to stocks and foreign currency in absolute value.<br>Investment advisor of the fund: Pi Financials Ltd.<br>Fund manager: Ayalon Mutual Funds Ltd.</p><p>This does not constitute a substitute for investment advice by a licensed investment advisor according to law, who takes into account the specific data and special needs of each person. Nothing stated above constitutes an offer to purchase fund units. The purchase of units in the fund is only based on the fund's prospectuses in effect at the time of purchase and immediate reports. Past performance of the fund does not guarantee similar returns in the future.</small></small></p></small></p>        </div>

        
                
